{"title":"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Three dice with faces numbered <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are stacked as shown. Seven of the eighteen faces are visible, leaving eleven faces hidden (back, bottom, between). The total number of dots NOT visible in this view is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/e/e6edba55d99924ea2b25e28f44f68200e0b47bed.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(2,0)--(3,1)--(3,7)--(1,7)--(0,6)--cycle); draw((3,7)--(2,6)--(0,6)); draw((3,5)--(2,4)--(0,4)); draw((3,3)--(2,2)--(0,2)); draw((2,0)--(2,6));  dot((1,1)); dot((.5,.5)); dot((1.5,.5)); dot((1.5,1.5)); dot((.5,1.5)); dot((2.5,1.5)); dot((.5,2.5)); dot((1.5,2.5)); dot((1.5,3.5)); dot((.5,3.5)); dot((2.25,2.75)); dot((2.5,3)); dot((2.75,3.25)); dot((2.25,3.75)); dot((2.5,4)); dot((2.75,4.25)); dot((.5,5.5)); dot((1.5,4.5)); dot((2.25,4.75)); dot((2.5,5.5)); dot((2.75,6.25)); dot((1.5,6.5)); [/asy]\" width=\"108\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/6/0665a646fc36cb639ccb8856c55898ec4a200e85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 21 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 22 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 31 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 41 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 53$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"375\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The numbers on one die total <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/5/fe5d632170ae20e416f7311f25ab463b423ea953.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2+3+4+5+6 = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"207\" height=\"14\" />, so the numbers\non the three dice total <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/8/848ec5b5f695afbacb864efead154761481780c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$63$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/4/964963ecab9f3fcffe1008ab8f844a23bbec4340.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"111\" height=\"16\" /> are visible, and these total <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d111a5e00ee5ea6700bb629994dc629874c505b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />.\nThis leaves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/9/929d2fce61573e3754391b606f130441dee47b05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$63 - 22 = \\boxed{\\text{(D) 41}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"142\" height=\"28\" /> not seen.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"